 "solution": "\\(\\mathrm{i}z=\\mathrm{i}(1+\\mathrm{i})=\\mathrm{i}+\\mathrm{i}^2=-1+\\mathrm{i}\\)；\\(3\\bar z=3(1-\\mathrm{i})=3-3\\mathrm{i}\\)。\n\\(\\mathrm{i}z+3\\bar z=(-1+3)+(1-3)\\mathrm{i}=2-2\\mathrm{i}\\)。\n\\(|2-2\\mathrm{i}|=\\sqrt{2^2+(-2)^2}=2\\sqrt2\\)，选 D。",
